+  [`evidence/body-mutated-verification.k`](evidence/body-mutated-verification.k);
+- exact diff:
+  [`evidence/stage5-body-mutation-diff.log`](evidence/stage5-body-mutation-diff.log);
+- clean mutated build: exit 0,
